        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-19T22:29:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you elaborate on that? The analysis that I\u0027ve done is simply taken a look at the voltage waveform on an oscilloscope to see that it converges with minimal oscillation. I\u0027ve also done this in the state where the SoC is off as well as when the SoC is on and therefore the load is more dynamic.",
      "parentUuid": "466dc67e_fb55fe49",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "8f595750717b97e3db66fc06852c69a7b70bfc11",
